  "sourceTitle": "Welcome fastai to the Hugging Face Hub",
  "sourceBodyHash": "5f475cf719a061ead0ceda17b04c486c8b4abe30f6140b101fe15ceeac7e0f77",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "zcode",
  "requestedModel": "",
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:10:48.426583Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:10:48.426583Z",
  "totalBlocks": 50,
  "translatedBlocks": 50,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b33016192662e869",
      "translationZh": "让神经网络不再高冷……并分享它们",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "056e910c9e12945e",
      "translationZh": "在让深度学习变得平易近人这件事上，很少有人做得像 fast.ai 生态那么多。Hugging Face 的使命是民主化好的机器学习。让我们把获取机器学习（包括预训练模型）门槛高的时代翻篇，一起把这个精彩的领域推得更远。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "842e9c9266eb42b0",
      "translationZh": "fastai 是一个开源深度学习库，它借助 PyTorch 和 Python 提供高层组件，能在文本、视觉和表格数据上快速训练出准确、达到最先进结果的神经网络。而 fast.ai 这家公司不只是提供一个库：它已成长为由开源贡献者和神经网络学习者组成的蓬勃生态。比如可以看看他们的书和课程，加入 fast.ai 的 Discord 和论坛。加入他们的社区，你一定会学到东西！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c2ac116665c923b",
      "translationZh": "因为这一切（以及更多——本文作者正是 thanks to fast.ai 课程开启了自己的旅程），我们自豪地宣布：fastai 用户现在只需一行 Python 就能把模型分享、上传到 Hugging Face Hub。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e22b9578571dd5e",
      "translationZh": "👉 本文将介绍 fastai 与 Hub 的集成。你也可以把这篇教程作为 Colab notebook 打开。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce6b7d4c5de053fa",
      "translationZh": "我们要感谢 fast.ai 社区，特别是 Jeremy Howard、Wayde Gilliam 和 Zach Mueller 的反馈 🤗。本篇博文深受 fastai 文档中 Hugging Face Hub 部分的启发。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "370772b92de48048",
      "translationZh": "为什么要分享到 Hub？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b23bcd8c5ec4217",
      "translationZh": "Hub 是一个中央平台，任何人都可以在上面分享和探索模型、数据集和 ML 演示。它拥有最全的开源模型、数据集与演示合集。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d255bae7f22bd2b3",
      "translationZh": "在 Hub 上分享能让你的 fastai 模型影响更大——别人可以下载和探索它们。你还可以用 fastai 模型做迁移学习：加载别人的模型作为你任务的基础。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15c08f79d63c9c25",
      "translationZh": "任何人都可以在 hf.co/models 页面按 fastai 库筛选，访问 Hub 上所有 fastai 模型，如下图所示。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7b7dc266cc54189",
      "translationZh": "除了免费托管模型和面向更大社区的曝光，Hub 还内置基于 git 的版本控制（大文件用 git-lfs）以及用于可发现性与可复现性的模型卡。关于如何使用 Hub 的更多信息，见这篇介绍。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e74b915fe947fca0",
      "translationZh": "加入 Hugging Face 与安装",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02645f4c19e51c9a",
      "translationZh": "要在 Hub 上分享模型，你需要一个用户账号。到 Hugging Face 网站创建。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de2a053b4cd7132a",
      "translationZh": "huggingface_hub 库是一个轻量 Python 客户端，提供与 Hugging Face Hub 交互的实用函数。要把 fastai 模型推上 hub，需要预装一些库（fastai>=2.4、fastcore>=1.3.27 和 toml）。安装 huggingface_hub 时指定 [\"fastai\"] 即可自动安装，环境就绪：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "45f4b71c689dbdfe",
      "translationZh": "创建 fastai Learner",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53fe78d5537ce401",
      "translationZh": "这里我们训练 fastbook 里的第一个模型——识别猫 🐱。我们全力推荐读完整本 fastbook。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "32ec8076142755e2",
      "translationZh": "把 Learner 分享到 Hub",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9305fb13d7c3651d",
      "translationZh": "Learner 是 fastai 的对象，捆绑了模型、数据加载器和损失函数。本文中 Learner 与 Model 两个词互换使用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a95a6e71169f5eeb",
      "translationZh": "首先登录 Hugging Face Hub。你需要在 Account Settings 里创建一个 write token。登录有三种方式：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9461412fbdbb0d51",
      "translationZh": "在终端输入 huggingface-cli login 并输入你的 token。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fd5c6fd5980bc19",
      "translationZh": "在 Python notebook 里可以用 notebook_login。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77863b54f457ba9d",
      "translationZh": "使用 push_to_hub_fastai 函数的 token 参数。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bafc6ff98d09b488",
      "translationZh": "你可以把要上传的 Learner 和 Hub 仓库 id（格式为 \"namespace/repo_name\"）传给 push_to_hub_fastai。namespace 可以是个人账号或你有写权限的组织（例如 'fastai/stanza-de'）。更多细节见 Hub Client 文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d35f1375a0e9eb3",
      "translationZh": "Learner 现在已在 Hub 上名为 espejelomar/identify-my-cat 的仓库里。系统会自动创建一张模型卡，带有一些链接和后续步骤。把 fastai Learner（或任何模型）上传到 Hub 时，建议编辑它的模型卡（下图），让别人更好地理解你的工作（参考 Hugging Face 文档）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1091c4dfcc6c45c",
      "translationZh": "想进一步了解 push_to_hub_fastai，请看 Hub Client 文档，里面有一些你可能感兴趣的参数 👀。记住，你的模型就是一个 Git 仓库，享有版本控制、提交、分支等一切好处……",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f65e14fb3d9818e",
      "translationZh": "从 Hugging Face Hub 加载 Learner",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00b55e43842e7a00",
      "translationZh": "从 Hub 加载模型更简单。我们将加载我们的 Learner \"espejelomar/identify-my-cat\"，并用一张猫的图片测试（🦮？）。这段代码改编自 fastbook 第一章。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e54cc7fab54b7083",
      "translationZh": "先上传一张猫的图片（也可能是狗？）。配套的 Colab notebook 用 ipywidgets 交互式上传猫图（真的是猫吗？）。这里我们用这只可爱的猫 🐅：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00f5a214ec342b50",
      "translationZh": "现在加载我们刚分享到 Hub 的 Learner 并测试。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d9e721ca323b36f",
      "translationZh": "成功 👇！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6642ca81f9034801",
      "translationZh": "Hub Client 文档里有 from_pretrained_fastai 的更多细节。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "62e6f539419964af",
      "translationZh": "用 Blurr 混搭 fastai 与 Hugging Face Transformers（并分享它们）！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c38209d8f05d7a18",
      "translationZh": "[Blurr 是] 一个为想训练和部署 Hugging Face transformers 的 fastai 开发者设计的库 —— Blurr 文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d409eaabf111ae5c",
      "translationZh": "我们将：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20bb9c335df6ab11",
      "translationZh": "用 Blurr 高层 API 训练一个 blurr Learner。它会从 Hugging Face Hub 加载 distilbert-base-uncased 模型，并准备一个序列分类模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a441697ff51b0b31",
      "translationZh": "用 push_to_hub_fastai 把它分享到 Hub，命名空间为 fastai/blurr_IMDB_distilbert_classification。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a32a78411ac8d48d",
      "translationZh": "用 from_pretrained_fastai 加载，并用 learner_blurr.predict() 试用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75e914a9a11629ae",
      "translationZh": "协作与开源真棒！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49ed2ae54edc281c",
      "translationZh": "首先安装 blurr 并训练 Learner。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "571294a659753950",
      "translationZh": "用 push_to_hub_fastai 分享到 Hub。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d86ac0db84bd6a9",
      "translationZh": "用 from_pretrained_fastai 从 Hub 加载一个 blurr 模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08c90d9bde1b568d",
      "translationZh": "用几句话试试，用 learner_blurr.predict() 判断情感（负面或正面）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e66c10e38bbef4bd",
      "translationZh": "又成功了！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ff1257d106c90a9",
      "translationZh": "下一步？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bb7a81d3406ee46",
      "translationZh": "去上 fast.ai 课程（新版即将推出），在 Twitter 上关注 Jeremy Howard 和 fast.ai 获取动态，然后开始把你的 fastai 模型分享到 Hub 🤗。或者加载 Hub 上已有的模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfbe0b2aa87ffb47",
      "translationZh": "📧 欢迎通过 Hugging Face Discord 联系我们，如果你有项目点子也请分享。我们非常乐意听到你的反馈 💖。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b4c46204beb61ad",
      "translationZh": "想把你的库集成进 Hub 吗？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac9ad79044a5fd39",
      "translationZh": "这次集成归功于 huggingface_hub 库。想把你的库接入 Hub，我们为你准备了指南！或者直接 @ 一下 Hugging Face 团队的成员。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60c85f3a466b5e2e",
      "translationZh": "向 Hugging Face 团队为这次集成的全部工作致敬，特别是 @osanseviero 🦙。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dc06a4b667c4322",
      "translationZh": "感谢 fastlearners 和 hugging learners 🤗。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
